                        "type": "flashcard",
                        "card_title": "Working step",
                        "front": "10^4 \\equiv 25 \\pmod{19}",
                        "front_style": "math_formula",
                        "avatar_line": "Now, we calculate 5 squared, which is 25. Therefore, 10^4 is congruent to 25 modulo 19.",
                        "avatar_emotion": "encouraging"
                      },
                      {
                        "segment_id": "seg_004",
                        "type": "teaching",
                        "text": "Finally, we perform one last modulo operation to find the simplest form.",
                        "emotion": "enthusiastic"
