                      {
                        "segment_id": "seg_001",
                        "type": "teaching",
                        "text": "Hello! Today we're going to explore a problem involving arithmetic progressions, or A.P. for short. This problem requires us to show two results based on the lth, mth, and nth terms of an A.P. Follow along step-by-step, and we'll unravel this together!",
