                        "avatar_line": "First, substitute the general term equations into the main expression.",
                        "avatar_emotion": "encouraging"
                      },
                      {
                        "segment_id": "seg_004",
                        "type": "teaching",
                        "text": "Notice that the terms involving 'a' sum to zero because (m - n) + (n - l) + (l - m) is zero. This is an important observation!",
