                        "type": "flashcard",
                        "card_title": "Series Breakdown",
                        "front": "0.6666... = 0.6 + 0.06 + 0.006 + 0.0006 + ...",
                        "front_style": "math_formula",
                        "avatar_line": "This step helps us see 0.6666... as a sum of terms. It shows a pattern! Notice how each term is getting smaller.",
                        "avatar_emotion": "encouraging"
                      },
                      {
                        "segment_id": "seg_003",
                        "type": "teaching",
                        "text": "Now that we see this series, notice that each term after the first is a fraction of the previous one. This means we have a geometric progression (G.P.).",
