                        "front": "$n = -37 \\text{ or } n = 36$",
                        "front_style": "math_formula",
                        "avatar_line": "Setting each factor to zero gives us two solutions: n = -37 and n = 36.",
                        "avatar_emotion": "encouraging"
                      },
                      {
                        "segment_id": "seg_007",
                        "type": "teaching",
                        "text": "However, n must be a natural number, so we discard n = -37.",
