                  "solution": "(i) $1^3 + 2^3 + 3^3 + \\dots + 16^3 = \\left\\lceil \\frac{16 \\times (16 + 1)}{2} \\right\\rceil^2 = (136)^2 = 18496$\n(ii) $9^3 + 10^3 + \\dots + 21^3 = (1^3 + 2^3 + 3^3 + \\dots + 21^3) - (1^3 + 2^3 + 3^3 + \\dots + 8^3)$ $= \\left\\lceil \\frac{21 \\times (21 + 1)}{2} \\right\\rceil^2 - \\left\\lceil \\frac{8 \\times (8 + 1)}{2} \\right\\rceil^2 = (231)^2 - (36)^2 = 52065$"
                }
              },
